<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian chancellor says Austria to make EMU start.</title>
<headline>Austrian chancellor says Austria to make EMU start.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Chancellor Viktor Klima, delivering his maiden speech to parliament, said on Wednesday he was confident Austria would be among the first nations to join a single European currency.</p>
<p>Klima, finance minister before taking over the government reins, underlined that Austria succeeded in beating its own overall debt target in 1996 for the first time in five years.</p>
<p>&quot;It is certain that Austria will fulfil all the criteria for European Economic and Monetary Union,&quot; Klima said. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-254</p>
</text>
